+// NumberField scrub (CK-27), with its own pitch (CK-12), its arming surface (CK-22) and no
+// veil (CK-25). Q-3′ (i), INBOUND O-103f: every modality engages in place (no top layer, no
+// footprint, no place written), and the lens (the slider's loupe) is laid on its subject's
+// painted box. D5 pass 14 (P-E14 §S14): the frame read. Every frame a host is on the stage
+// its layout key and its painted place are read in the frame's resize step: a carrier's move
+// and an asked scroll are carried, a move of the place is glided from where it was painted
+// (by the chain's −Δ below every transform, on paint otherwise), a layout animation's
+// velocity is carried, an `!important` translate is refused loud at the hold, and a released
